    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it's just hard to \"just be\" when being itself feels so heavy. it feels like i'm just waiting for something that's never coming back. sometimes i think like... if the thing that made life worth it is gone, then the rest of it is just noise, isn't it? just a long, loud nothingness.",
